The project states "CC-by-sa-4.0 for content" at the commit above.
Names, function words, particles, interjections, and junk tokens were
dropped. The Hebrew pointing and the English glosses were added for this
fixture. Every item is marked verified false until a person checks it.

Band 0 words are copied, pointing included, from the tutor's existing
lesson worksheets. They are not covered by the FrequencyWords licence.

The pseudo-words were written for this test. They are not taken from the
list, and they are not inserted into the lexicon.
